    },
    {
      "excerpt": null,
      "id": "evidence:openalex:fb4341ec1646203f19410485",
      "kind": "observed",
      "raw_sha256": "72f08e8a224ad2745abcb830c41347694870aa89063c14947ab8989dc7018332",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:30:16.321114Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:91ab915b8c2b2660459451c613e67f978cc28b4316e0d4ab54670db871167a8d#results[7]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4283326514",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Founded on population-based training and information-theoretic trajectory space diversity regularization, OEOM generates a dynamic set of opponents.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:009c53ee9deb2e3a619c520fc612b35d79df9a5e54acfdc499542543c139ea34",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "1f35ffca70e55942a25ae687dc72ef18fa60d2f713dfbeeb01b9f8f70dcdc9ae",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:29:28.324608Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:258acf0ce16db35b7eccec5ae908319720682fefceb4c3b582b0556b5c528057#results[29];abstract[674:822]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409362833",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "In this work, we propose a learning approach termed differentially private data-free distillation (DPDFD) for model conversion that can convert a pretrained model (teacher) into its privacy-preserving counterpart (student) via an intermediate generator without access to training data.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:113ca850e3701d550babcffe36905069360c9325bddedb9ee9cdaa8a073df2c7",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "7a2e64ae41a687242a99fc98b29089a552aa73e206bf44b0e7c5d3a1ba19ae92",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:30:23.328057Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:8fbadd4d5611e2cde37692d567262013f0af08c2a4767f5d96cfa2bada53bf69#results[27];abstract[225:510]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4385768224",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "We propose a novel method that leverages a text-to-video diffusion transformer to generate annotated data for model training.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:126230af8c761e368b75bcd109f25de2bbd42e6f4795f9bdaed715959f94734c",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "98a43269b5615bc10ee8e17b2e5a83e867eab2234fe4e0ae2f2f59e00b4ab4c9",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:30:58.635160Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:880ea8991a7ed694ec99249c8fdb4f958f2aeb27342678b512ce45f7cdbba58c#results[14];abstract[192:317]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4414359999",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Specifically, the DDM synthesizes highly condensed samples guided by the classifier, forcing the model to learn compacted essential class-related clues from a few incremental samples.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:148f3c11f327c1efe63ff2af662ffae53d719efe538a1c75c889ae0190089b47",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "b97151f9f5161fe2ba73207dbc785edd16194e31920ac6e800b0649b57ab187b",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:31:09.744245Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:fb0053492e400525e1a9e3cc45bd1d94fb9e24320da8d393ee7238acbeb22b81#results[17];abstract[679:862]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4414359326",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "While previous diffusion-based neural vocoders typically follow a noise-to-data generation pipe-line, the linear-degradation prior of the mel-spectrogram is often neglected, resulting in limited generation quality.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:165ebed1eef864ebf31aa53f51d814391fb48626b90e3f689155ccb6ddd2f29d",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "9e4b0b3ae3b6fce1f3adb7679fa69b97ac0177842f6499a9acb6955cffc8c2cb",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:31:20.599634Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:4e4de026fb86db03a20a378f388f1e6d2ab0bd8a0e1281d84b14efac36df355d#results[33];abstract[0:214]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4414359624",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "To address this issue, we propose a method that guides the inversion process towards the core distribution for compositional embeddings.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:27bbf11cbb90519d8a9743df613a2441f60ffcccb95bc78707ef5b666c1f6f0b",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "303c92542e640342818b2b84fc15d63e8e108abe145fad295e26c05afda46946",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:27:37.857135Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:555b071564e5b200f5731f53284971429caf65f5c311f329c8cf163b6237f4b3#results[25];abstract[512:648]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4393159706",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "This framework seamlessly integrates discriminative and generative models in a training-free manner, leveraging discriminative models for initial predictions and endowing deep neural networks with rethinking capabilities via diffusion models.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:2bd51cc757ac02f663153f3a9bdf5dcb66ac04b1216f18a59959375ea32e44f3",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "0e1d20b584eaee92be4fe87f4fd15c95bdf2ee1f9cc4f80d7671ab4aa9471531",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:28:38.115685Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:9dfaba142bcc06da647fa04862c92607cd39a3cf64bffc313c7ba354f262d1c3#results[37];abstract[659:901]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409367175",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "In recent years, diffusion models have revolutionized visual generation, outperforming traditional frameworks like Generative Adversarial Networks (GANs).",
      "id": "evidence:topic:323c71103d71aef00fa3c73078f92dbc505f8108ddb6645ba140edc390fdcec1",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "c5f6a586798b40d8308141a55ed702056d5bd38e027c466fafd4734e2705483f",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:28:46.204450Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:82f1c3eb235119df2c813bea8bdda297e1a8064cac21fe37aa69b01528ec5f56#results[30];abstract[0:154]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409366637",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Our method makes efficient use of the pre-trained diffusion models with computational feasibility compared to the conditional diffusion models, which need to be trained from scratch.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:3277c026272bdc2adf27e475ed7f6ff5faba257a85d60df564132c4df6944105",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "ce9017386a2d7669301c2859ce1114cb2df72477d2066c8c6d5f901753b0d20b",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:27:22.095170Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:86267671d288a39614ccab076919913c0a4e14e351c6653f8f68fbdecf92e742#results[40];abstract[454:636]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4393149669",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Our method can be broadly applied to different types of GANs.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:32e2837d5bd96f850d0519badb9851c6406fb33c458f56e7609f595aba842a13",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "8c684456737c55e56ef3af175dc422f8fa292155972e1e652a3522022648bc47",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:25:32.069048Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:f4f5328be21e09ecf1b35109773ece332b7b2f998583de8c183c37a3346d668b#results[38];abstract[790:851]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4283820492",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "While encouraging, these works are restricted to model-level attribution, only capable of handling images generated by seen models with a specific seed, loss and dataset, which is limited in real-world scenarios when fake images may be generated by privately trained models.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:4014fb77a22063e84ae2e0f501b2c3668a5ac6cf7a3ddab027a1c91d41c90813",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "f1845b8be14ea1470a407fb576a1ad55eb49ef5f6be7d61ef21bf54e07cb6a09",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:25:49.761616Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:e20e81546504a7a40f7e97601c207ded537d7a7acdd2119ff62230811a6feb8b#results[6];abstract[273:547]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4283811667",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "To address these challenges, dataset condensation has been developed to learn a small synthetic set that preserves essential information from the original large-scale dataset.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:43999e0de2ff23643b2b92002994431ecd59e4a8eecf12202392cba49054e6fd",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "36b391b33e221a1ccb22fb11abab18247d1e31140ae7df6630219bf1afcfc84e",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:27:43.535795Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:32ccc422528436169af4ae6dc9e14c6ca592da0a34f7fb5fe4ea2869132ed955#results[5];abstract[129:304]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4393147801",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Furthermore, we propose an entropy-based noise-controlling strategy to enable the injected noise to be adaptively constrained regarding the smoothness of the similarity distribution.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:51d3cd32ad004ed37181af5318fd3932e32f5889b573e81424e7183934be75c1",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "4f8b8a00e16dbbe3d8eceb33ddf098b23f5ab0837a322b76d5f58cc1370e2857",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:29:29.153124Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:28a2cc118a57cf801d9d83d31b43d4fa520475e70f5522a4fdbbbb0825c5f9a1#results[18];abstract[877:1059]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409348240",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "However, this assumption proves ineffective in diffusion models due to the random noise sampled during the training process.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:54c537474b7e574f82db75940e399fe154429d359d6c08b3145024513640ae2d",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "aba492f7d7d63d2f4dbbac34aa920238b2c794166e0d74f855b453feb4829f8e",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:31:07.459650Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:1f8a49e5cca0d11028eb5a09d38b749c0cb461cf8393fa0414210f9ef6e9fdc8#results[49];abstract[644:768]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4414360511",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Drawing inspiration from the DDM, we propose the Dropout-based Drift-Diffusion Model (DDDM) that combines test-phase dropout and the DDM for improving the robustness for arbitrary neural networks.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:5fa36a12cc656d4088634c0522a45a1b77cea7bf4b3b3fb6ecde898ce8e99cae",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "6252091c118b9bb68660c27d8e6f0032eebead3e1cf6b1f74696c9dc4e005ea1",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:30:10.030956Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:faeb46be6113384ef0bcd23286681cd9dd839ee48abfb2a229ad1ece7d482ec5#results[21];abstract[644:840]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4285602482",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "In response, we propose FedGCS, a novel generative client selection framework that innovatively recasts the client selection process as a generative task.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:630369f8a1992013ba528a10c07cbf6eeb4a2f9bdfc377152dd6ada0cf0af292",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "2aa89f39a5b74cafddf28acf29861e13f048ad6c8c9f3eb03c4a5273df9f3a46",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:30:49.192391Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:0dd61dbf99d7fd3c783fe65500e6c27073fc6e9974ca89a689201735bd6a6210#results[2];abstract[308:462]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4401023724",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Generative adversarial networks (GANs) have achieved remarkable progress in recent years, but the continuously growing scale of models make them challenging to deploy widely in practical applications.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:651c27e3110f7c1da35522f71783c9e6c406d89078be85888f695d1bf45f2fdf",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "ac2ed57201651f090afbda17cbc1c6b64205bf188fb727a7dee8af20a103796e",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:24:53.775200Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:f871bb5a39d904991fdf4940a2a1917d4c021451fb28c8d8c782799360ba1527#results[13];abstract[0:200]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3173855227",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "In the context of neural networks, we put this theoretical framework into practice as PDE+ (PDE with Adaptive Distributional Diffusion) which diffuses each sample into a distribution covering semantically similar inputs.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:66808fed81bd49871dd3836a31afdfe3ab99b5ed590608e4c9885db1513ecb93",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "8fce3befc6f4083d7aeb37b278d795b1cd5a1b218818613e4a90de36f23959c8",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:28:08.298788Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:4fcdf484d6ee314bb4d8f022396f823e8116701df50393f466829bf3ad35d7c4#results[34];abstract[975:1195]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4393160311",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "However, current methods model the whole image as an overall neural radiance field, which limits the partial semantic editability of synthetic results.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:68ff30dd586cc86b5a53c9584dca62b11e00f50879a019f92b86ab3df0f82c9b",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "5ad166181f99b3407d1b6525503f0e61b150e2ed384d91b855a8ce41c37fbf3c",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:26:31.342430Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:d9c8e7f17940797ec7b6158da631a6e616d48de85a9d5736d6040c4ddc1da6cc#results[28];abstract[81:232]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4382461079",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Motivated by these findings, we propose two methods for faithful generation: 1) augmented training by incorporating the auxiliary entity information, including both an augmented plan-based model and an unsupervised model and 2) training instance selection based on faithfulness ranking.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:6ed5f1f2d63a32df8503c04f74e51510041ad16d12c7be941449b13caaf3d780",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "281469776a6ef84c17bc67fb86c1c020db24910aa570baed16c9752f6baee30c",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:25:21.698827Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:45b817f6b306d66546d473a504d56912ef9fd892acd4daa960825a0c3896c566#results[29];abstract[602:888]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3175929660",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "MinGRE employs a multi-dimensional attention mechanism to reweight spatiotemporal gradients, minimizing the gradient distribution discrepancies across classes.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:72387fa2d015784b9660282e08c07bf573dfd302f629617190fc7eb85345b8cb",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "7b7edf47a2fff06460510dfebc9331bd875bdb246f28de9100dff4cb3f4d5941",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:29:00.364398Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:1bb42fd368784f76168bef39bbfe70539323d4676fa2daa099a9c2a1aab14e18#results[36];abstract[835:994]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409364949",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Stochastic partial differential equations (SPDEs) are crucial for modelling dynamics with randomness in many areas including economics, physics, and atmospheric sciences.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:854ee0d2382a0fe800a92ceb724b5701349f55d7278a3268a76ac09ddf405601",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "c56216f7f52392e31a731edb3d255c154c67a5917295ab85a1dbf129739e3f02",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:26:52.197269Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:855b7bee403478b7f4d848d9f0f33029bb9ee6e7096b266be34deb398e9af68a#results[44];abstract[0:170]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4382239748",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Experimental results show that our model is superior to traditional generative models in both automatic indicators and human evaluation.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:88af6340e499cd11315926a5146b1b65ca617464c065ef95735f931f3868eec9",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "17399b07c67aa600e818296b06161126b33017304f507754302d527f9f409b82",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:25:26.132467Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:7f21a584aba3767f0ff04c17a4eaf19b723daf495acde5ae5053263fb13cf358#results[31];abstract[1379:1515]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3134648508",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "In this paper, we mathematically model the data distribution and the discrepancy at the incremental stages with mixture uniform distribution (MUD).",
      "id": "evidence:topic:8ef69ecdb77351a1e1668530cfcdb25a1735c6529c3d98d68a4c4bb48bac95c0",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "103147f596797f933ad3f3df06f4c202a7511c1bf33075d9b2bc779287c69ad5",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:26:58.625637Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:587744790f091f8914d47f5ad3008b4a13e6f81eb4e96560293b7767ceae02de#results[20];abstract[324:471]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4382203080",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "To overcome this challenge, we propose Fair Mapping, a flexible, model-agnostic, and lightweight approach that modifies a pre-trained text-to-image diffusion model by controlling the prompt to achieve fair image generation.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:9441c9656fba36f0ab833c7b00032418dec43ffe6552c8ed60218d66303818e7",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "5cdd85b5005faff0876c29ed7b16d705de5e5c7eb64479ba23b13f14a445323e",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:29:38.514054Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:6d84f6ef28755f2013fac24d1d11a5204da81b841cc5e6cb9bce16df3ace3e31#results[4];abstract[303:526]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409361467",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "The integration of deep generative networks into generating Computer-Aided Design (CAD) models has garnered increasing attention over recent years.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:983d0f40433dab340f2aab4472d8a136dc49c28e6055e40a08d9fe2048793e06",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "0e1d20b584eaee92be4fe87f4fd15c95bdf2ee1f9cc4f80d7671ab4aa9471531",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:28:38.115685Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:9dfaba142bcc06da647fa04862c92607cd39a3cf64bffc313c7ba354f262d1c3#results[18];abstract[0:147]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409367420",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Text-to-image (T2I) diffusion models have achieved remarkable progress in generating realistic images from textual descriptions.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:a788a3d23b7910aa5a0c4c4f11ced1c466e418f0521aff300ae1681814322c62",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "86b7418a54125234a3686116e1b8e9dd139a1b2e2c04dc0070d3e91ac33f6ff1",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:28:52.744127Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:60f63490836472b3ee67500acec70bf1f790d556db0a8dccceb6aec36305fb70#results[48];abstract[0:128]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409366155",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Generative diffusion models have then gained prominence for producing synthetic datasets, yet existing text-to-data methods struggle with generating complex scenes involving multiple objects and intricate spatial arrangements.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:b3b89926a0cf556d8cf8d273af7a9e8fe57ba491886ebdb200036e5e6064fb30",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "86b7418a54125234a3686116e1b8e9dd139a1b2e2c04dc0070d3e91ac33f6ff1",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:28:52.744127Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:60f63490836472b3ee67500acec70bf1f790d556db0a8dccceb6aec36305fb70#results[41];abstract[167:393]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409366126",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "The incredible generative ability of large-scale text-to-image (T2I) models has demonstrated strong power of learning complex structures and meaningful semantics.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:b6098f43cff1f23848fa5b0a62ddc6552be40be3b2df24287ec2daa86fb0c1f6",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "1001ea203b1dd004432fd43d64eb83a4b7114bb5d8cca206c4084a8f55b6ee51",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:27:27.365543Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:777190ea48c163fdc166751de0cc1de898a88adff4759fa52ac5b5126f4bce4a#results[0];abstract[0:162]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4393148714",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "To achieve this, we first generate multi-scale striped masks to remove a part of regions from the normal samples, and then train a generative adversarial network to reconstruct the unseen regions.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:c74d22c7efd3b5a8d5c9bb1c8377c6ff5e3bf89b11efe03f9104f30d13f60c61",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "087c4fc82972d3feda637e8c9be27fdd789056436f29422eaf777037084e5099",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:24:31.254032Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:691f737e4a266368137cb11d51e38dfaeeeb671d8de87f6c7b508dea8f20c553#results[2];abstract[472:668]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3173538657",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "In this paper, we propose PanoDiT, a framework that utilizes the Diffusion Transformer (DiT) architecture to generate panoramic videos from text descriptions.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:d2340e9191175c18f1fef2689f9b2db7032c4a2f9a0a8d3738e7a96415464817",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "5a775517a3756a0af99d326c6e37779c4f0c0d6b0f20a22e3308462661f5a519",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:28:54.335866Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:eded01a84a6a5b149512ecdd0bfb4c31f26d9b1ece9cd07895f2acc69789e9dd#results[22];abstract[489:647]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409365009",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Specifically, for better distribution estimation, we propose the coefficient net (Conet), which can be any neural architectures, to map input sequences into learnable distribution coefficients.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:ea062acdebad042fbe5c04567571fbe4de96759e95bf41fc7f81b0673c360b75",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "c56216f7f52392e31a731edb3d255c154c67a5917295ab85a1dbf129739e3f02",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:26:52.197269Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:855b7bee403478b7f4d848d9f0f33029bb9ee6e7096b266be34deb398e9af68a#results[2];abstract[846:1039]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4382239131",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "For the reactant generation, GDiffRetro employs a conditional diffusion model in 3D to further transform the obtained synthon into a complete reactant.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:faedb746524fb923d1e14bb42e482015da8f5217bc32e83cc3e7ef12cf427527",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "cbaa8b74117652f19122cc780fe6e1aefe595255b0384e8a27cf084a590b6000",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:29:03.359512Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:d4ff7a618296c251f836d57e85a6f6cc4112ccacbd6045702b631421e7d6676d#results[19];abstract[975:1126]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409365581",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "To preserve the diversity of generation, we employ a trainable control condition encoder that is enhanced by a large language model and a trainable Fusion-Net to encode and fuse the additional conditions while keeping the weights of the pre-trained text-to-audio model frozen.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:fc41230799d116e009bfe3555fa6a023a921cfd1ee9e29468026290c6b9424f1",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "9c7d1b5c6ae25e9ac6653320af62b1c200b2d0b254bafb96fe21191aca44eee5",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:28:13.238812Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:d7ac626e1c711d3f799f5faf5b8ad479449965adb3aba35fe42516ae1ec9fb11#results[9];abstract[550:826]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4393147260",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "We theoretically prove that a biased teacher could cause severe disparity on different groups of synthetic data in adversarial distillation, which further exacerbates the mode collapse of a generator and consequently degenerates the overall accuracy of a distilled student model.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:fe266e030e870772d75a7bfca9a1b03374ac924af081aeab9f80e71325e00072",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "823971fc7b6f60c1355fd7fb74eaa970260673cb0317c9b3d5e165a283998af6",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:27:24.878086Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:be120c57ed8816e6b9b691ab1aa00ef2f9cefc715e29c4f1b2f83d1031b5a49a#results[35];abstract[634:913]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4393149093",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    }
