    {
      "excerpt": null,
      "id": "evidence:openalex:fb54ad24f44d47e81970f1da",
      "kind": "observed",
      "raw_sha256": "8b39c4cf606a9e0d0d1a8423134606232933c397ae1de87add8a987deab9dc4e",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:27:47.298916Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:1d5b3c1aa55cd32612284069bd7d7930165767c3fb59c2181534790458bf8c57#results[37]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4393156209",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Answer Set Programming (ASP) has emerged as a promising paradigm in knowledge representation and automated reason- ing owing to its ability to model hard combinatorial problems from diverse domains in a natural way.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:0438fc2a7109e981dca841697c6735a657520985f78a526e6fbba830a3021b9e",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "8b39c4cf606a9e0d0d1a8423134606232933c397ae1de87add8a987deab9dc4e",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:27:47.298916Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:1d5b3c1aa55cd32612284069bd7d7930165767c3fb59c2181534790458bf8c57#results[16];abstract[0:215]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4393159749",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "In this work, we propose the first exact Pseudo-Boolean model counter, PBCount , that relies on knowledge compilation approach via algebraic decision diagrams.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:22c883ac5cf475dc3cd290d09c0509263a31bc8ee425ab939f4f5d586cb3ac70",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "574f7c6f22b1a74f85c04bdb4f1b32990d660a6d60dab931164657b227c49ef4",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:27:41.106011Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:5b4bb370e08627374de6bf0cfc9353e0fca71fb23b2c02683f54ce6c960e021b#results[43];abstract[647:806]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4393148132",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "It is a popular planning paradigm with applications ranging from robot planning to dialogue-agent design and reactive synthesis.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:286f06d517fb0150db1d13d65c7e84ba6c869136bc0404f170046bb402595045",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "675cf4833796735608e0a43cc554ef432d6482faa8cca91ef1f02d6c18685f84",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:28:20.223640Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:f3aca61f79c7d51715a64cc5a9557fd45e1c767b2593efb92ebe720abc2c55aa#results[12];abstract[186:314]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4393157400",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "One approach to probabilistic inference involves counting the number of models of a given Boolean formula.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:43f6ddeb36b1c4b22eecf7fc2ed2f4511b2be7a53889a7347257f6805d2b20de",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "574f7c6f22b1a74f85c04bdb4f1b32990d660a6d60dab931164657b227c49ef4",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:27:41.106011Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:5b4bb370e08627374de6bf0cfc9353e0fca71fb23b2c02683f54ce6c960e021b#results[44];abstract[0:106]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4393159133",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "The Abstraction and Reasoning Corpus (ARC) aims at benchmarking the performance of general artificial intelligence algorithms.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:59e12e7531a9380f1e28935e8d158a74deede1985682747d987772124b1d1762",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "fa27e47b1e0f18ea1f56fa3bcd53be4a7c2fa7da5d251e7ea28ba7ad08d68388",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:26:40.197641Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:9f4c386f5e3794f6716b6a0592e17bceb06e70c07eb003d7144c47ec2703557a#results[16];abstract[0:126]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4382239581",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "We propose BaMCTS, a Monte Carlo Tree Search framework for finding backdoors to MIPs.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:6b7c6a16f507f0be167e790f1688dce07b42d82d10fac383a444f076955e591b",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "1b3068309293e198df33e250ad1b634f034de92bb512902a6bffa7192ed1fdad",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:25:45.560719Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:6cda1bc1a36609c08e568babbf769605f650225da44911e6714e9ab9b29364a8#results[23];abstract[902:987]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3206580908",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Finally, we show how plans which minimize side effects of different types can be computed via compilations to cost-optimizing symbolic planning, and investigate experimentally.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:731d77de84b7637f1313d9a8c28012d9892c1aca8a1f4b7ce48fb2443f8f5f6c",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "1a3bdb6666b0952626c0a042fdba52cdce8e3ead65976dcac09419c01e9e0f5d",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:26:15.219017Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:d5e89e7ba11f9243d770f8d0e61f89b861d2c7eb3f7a77a61fadfb359ff8d3f3#results[21];abstract[645:821]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4283802141",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "The current DIDP solvers are based on heuristic search, and the state-of-the-art solver, complete anytime beam search (CABS), uses beam search.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:7d262fe1da6df4a3a821cf96f2209eab977572d19c389e6cce6a5a54b303eb1b",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "c1e25ce2dc00af9014ceb07405ea44e6146835bb9dc15d56e1e50154317f3c46",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:28:21.958945Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:e7499b02d1d49ae4471da4363697849ec8c805d65c12714778826715b69a200f#results[21];abstract[259:402]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4393160751",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "In this paper, we present a method for applying LNS to improve anytime maximum satisfiability (MaxSAT) solving by introducing a neighbourhood selection policy that shows good empirical performance.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:a0a1ed8eafcb2e0ffb7e6d17afdfe19769803cb1d9edd0fd33c064990beac724",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "313b3314a2a65d7974bcb260f028b2eb72069b208e4dfaadee0d38943cca8d3d",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:30:06.951218Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:fae9741c7ed7fbf519b36579d262fc1a0fe9f954851cd443b460096d8d98a265#results[31];abstract[136:333]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4285600159",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Recent advances in symbolic dynamic programming (SDP) have significantly broadened the class of MDPs for which exact closed-form value functions can be derived.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:a1728cd389980dcaeb58b73dac55ac1cab27f0ec7788b66364ae9d1444ba8607",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "5fd550f4e64359d9f741b32a084f8e4f713b4f89b2547cdb44178926a52d4ca4",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:29:59.339088Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:efcf852c5be8b7c4c9ec530f6d8d35ac62a5be1fd914fdcaab4dba5185ace8fd#results[41];abstract[0:160]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3187079608",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "In this paper, we present Neuro#, an approach for learning branching heuristics to improve the performance of exact #SAT solvers on instances from a given family of problems.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:acf1c75b4f571ebbd1e301aa78108dcecf94e7e63dc3039475efff2a48e02712",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "42a914d02381733eee64c05206ff29683efcb34537e43afd49281d1a686c0761",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:25:18.028499Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:5160fe6c0ee6997af9d8879f30b410b928594e0f296e250fdd46138368bf8fac#results[46];abstract[391:565]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3176021534",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Model counting is a fundamental task that involves determining the number of satisfying assignments to a logical formula, typically in conjunctive normal form (CNF).",
      "id": "evidence:topic:b44cebe9e5a6b11f109ce61bb93f21ffd740793353edbe54dcbdfc6eee4d84b1",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "43f4689046dc4c434e5c5f13bfcaa572c4f983e897a3a1384baeb52584ed6611",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:28:59.325095Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:c574330d8f606e5c161aadedc3bde039deb6597cedf512738cd17ae9bea8967d#results[26];abstract[0:165]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409366064",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "In this work, we present Type-WA*, a novel bounded suboptimal planning algorithm that augments WA* with type-based exploration while still satisfying WA*'s theoretical solution-quality guarantee.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:bfeda9ba7cb0006e429cbf0041c02e61d610af62f835b3824b3b9e2b29ba5ac0",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "5fd550f4e64359d9f741b32a084f8e4f713b4f89b2547cdb44178926a52d4ca4",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:29:59.339088Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:efcf852c5be8b7c4c9ec530f6d8d35ac62a5be1fd914fdcaab4dba5185ace8fd#results[47];abstract[408:603]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3190502896",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
