    {
      "excerpt": null,
      "id": "evidence:openalex:ffd37d696ddc7831b920a0ee",
      "kind": "observed",
      "raw_sha256": "4e1cf9c548cb2fcd1c3420593203d1c75d40526e4dbd113e352279600e4ff2cf",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:28:32.663925Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:f8dc0e2812cc2a6ff3c55dff8138b4ba6dc2316e821a6585cac5281e8a687970#results[40]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409370097",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "In this work, we propose a knowledge distillation method LRC-BERT based on contrastive learning to fit the output of the intermediate layer from the angular distance aspect, which is not considered by the existing distillation methods.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:01b1d5d172f534e6c8b755d3db53c9047218890e8e97ba113bbbfd8cb848f4f1",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "42a914d02381733eee64c05206ff29683efcb34537e43afd49281d1a686c0761",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:25:18.028499Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:5160fe6c0ee6997af9d8879f30b410b928594e0f296e250fdd46138368bf8fac#results[11];abstract[283:518]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3173482217",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Unfortunately, in real-world scenarios, representation learning is usually fragile to task-irrelevant distractions such as variations in background or viewpoint.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:023bc69604967f3c007e9594d837d1d5cd2676a8a8723c0a5d87523d1a3e9010",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "967ed70afccf7c9e57881a59e2383c6b651cf375e951842b9176885ae8b5f2ff",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:26:56.984634Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:fb6df0696983d9a53feaf0ee46d680d8ba0c83310f34731c8699e82732794774#results[26];abstract[134:295]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4382237565",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Current methods typically obtain target domain semantics centers from an unconstrained continuous image representation space.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:04072d5bef82b7474a3e751b5c4f36eba177dea9b3a46067ee25b97adfb85db7",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "e5e50196fcdc4c3ea7ae85154a41cf79f3e19ab73d603ec5da8a68abcdc8540f",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:29:13.693777Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:fb666590c409a515a530c348e30cfd9a685e5720d6d0225efd0ad0df53def1ad#results[29];abstract[236:361]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409347077",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Typically, existing CBM methods associate the final layer of visual encoders with concepts to explain the model’s predictions.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:041e56344d4a002562fbfe9fb1aa3e4d4d398822f13fe023e87abefe6d6de477",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "cc9aeb5222573b8aff150b5e360d859f88818f0aa2c1e9a3cca70e3cacbde99d",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:31:12.240122Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:558ed5d0dd3f350614dd0e3ab202ba757f11232910382e9081bf6f35db95850f#results[6];abstract[209:335]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4414360698",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "We contribute in particular to a practical MB learning strategy, which can maintain feasibility and effectiveness in real-world data where variables can be numerical or categorical with linear or nonlinear, pairwise or multivariate relationships.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:047a88327dfbf6442674b4ae88960c55670da4231e121b65be7a7d4a03b27b37",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "ebb7af2c1f4929ae3b527896224d48d1e34e081f29ad02f79ecacaee0f71f5cc",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:27:01.328629Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:570c20add30c2d0c00b32415a9ef98bee5d63ad106e9d72e97dfe3ab782d6251#results[20];abstract[484:730]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4382318859",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Then we propose the hierarchical feature regularization method with these neuron models to regularize the backbone of a few-shot model, thus making it produce more generic and robust features for few-shot classification.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:07ace5dec56b2b6c37d3d78efa4fc8e95ebc7a8ce80cfb4819ef86013b07c98d",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "2b2a91f62164bd5b3c67f02261ef09326a1b7edfee48dbc71ea9f0a4619dcd20",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:26:25.574404Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:134f2d4b18ca0a99cb0eb3f3416edf79839da7efd08b43e0fbe13723bf7ab5b4#results[34];abstract[515:735]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4382469135",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Semi-supervised learning (SSL) is a machine learning paradigm that utilizes both labeled and unlabeled data to enhance the performance of learning tasks.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:090448e50d63d45e692c04db203a806db4edeb5205b010ba63954d5d81a36845",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "2aa89f39a5b74cafddf28acf29861e13f048ad6c8c9f3eb03c4a5273df9f3a46",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:30:49.192391Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:0dd61dbf99d7fd3c783fe65500e6c27073fc6e9974ca89a689201735bd6a6210#results[49];abstract[0:153]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4401024912",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Nevertheless, existing Text-to-Image (T2I) models are primarily trained on concrete physical objects and often struggle to visualize abstract concepts.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:0af69bcead8eadfa3b0b8dd7579ba21c6e8eb2183bde4c14b87bdab7c162993e",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "823971fc7b6f60c1355fd7fb74eaa970260673cb0317c9b3d5e165a283998af6",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:27:24.878086Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:be120c57ed8816e6b9b691ab1aa00ef2f9cefc715e29c4f1b2f83d1031b5a49a#results[18];abstract[541:692]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4393149035",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "By exploiting the heterogeneity of local structures in the embedding space, we propose a Neighborhood-Adaptive Structure Augmented metric learning framework (NASA), where the neighborhood structure is realized as a structure embedding, and learned along with the sample embedding in a self-supervised manner.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:0cf400b96c77cf2613a075c3bcac9137971aac7de46fda3771353a122cac1819",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "f4df7585a937d665c848c624c29dccc6fb35f48b3153bf241d1e4a16f9dfb354",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:25:34.686352Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:43f70b8a66387275d810917c4cd80bcaa5fbbd3b5f992f4f416c83fce372d698#results[30];abstract[801:1109]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4283821214",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Moreover, we adopt a self-supervised transformer model for deep feature extraction and show that it works well for calculating perceptual similarity.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:0f4bc0208c2a152eed354233ff37d71d08c03df802028cbc08eca61a647d40cb",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "2b2a91f62164bd5b3c67f02261ef09326a1b7edfee48dbc71ea9f0a4619dcd20",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:26:25.574404Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:134f2d4b18ca0a99cb0eb3f3416edf79839da7efd08b43e0fbe13723bf7ab5b4#results[3];abstract[466:615]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4382465386",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Specifically, we propose a novel part-based self-supervised representation learning scheme to learn transferable representations by maximizing the similarity of an image to its discriminative part.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:0fca4a06ce2f78bd68258fb3dca643ed6806834236c38353ed35069a1d3b2476",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "ff06d1ac9758308e9d9c446438ffd59512e85b019a621d31a203f2e31bb9c2a3",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:29:50.458970Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:3a74def3d95207a16576f6b35f0986661472be07a601fe83ecee17a003968dc0#results[19];abstract[403:600]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3189898312",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "This would mislead the feature representation learning and deteriorate the performance.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:1036ebcba5fbf383b8808a931e5d7656d15d59995d50aa6d1e6114eeaf9e202a",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "23021609cd2ea54eb76a5198eabf48f85b027abb7f5ce8cc17dc5722c2ab9aa3",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:24:33.071572Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:4568c2fc4c75a01f818f8d1d7a1fd00e62df5589cea8620e99fb944ce8dd6fc1#results[5];abstract[250:337]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3174505228",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Multi-modality pre-training paradigm that aligns protein sequences and biological descriptions has learned general protein representations and achieved promising performance in various downstream applications.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:1098ebe9ad81b8e126fb0ee9b944bb27046338038b20ad5087d77c0cb6c10b3d",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "1f35ffca70e55942a25ae687dc72ef18fa60d2f713dfbeeb01b9f8f70dcdc9ae",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:29:28.324608Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:258acf0ce16db35b7eccec5ae908319720682fefceb4c3b582b0556b5c528057#results[4];abstract[0:209]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409363126",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Subsequently, a weight injection module maps the class embeddings to classifier weights, enabling seamless expansion to new classes.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:116804d5dd0b25a12cceb5e177e7ea5b68b6388918cd452171f50dc24ea62686",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "eb4a6bb08dc3665909f0887729c1629e955a8fc6c6ac0a041695309831b2cf53",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:31:13.066731Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:b4fe5a41da37cd04c2b45c78337192f0a30bbf87c536c0b711f42a13459e286c#results[13];abstract[858:990]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4414359647",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Note that our proposed method is end-to-end trainable, character recognition can be concurrently performed, and no post-processing is needed.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:12526da18fc384efa86c19500b4b52d7b7ef294ac7d12e747f47631564a54dfb",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "23021609cd2ea54eb76a5198eabf48f85b027abb7f5ce8cc17dc5722c2ab9aa3",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:24:33.071572Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:4568c2fc4c75a01f818f8d1d7a1fd00e62df5589cea8620e99fb944ce8dd6fc1#results[39];abstract[888:1029]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3175981075",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Then, such two-layer ontology is further used to generate the task groups, in which each task group contains partial image categories with similar learning complexities and one particular base deep network is learned.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:13ad0205488dec417ec33575c91171938f8b588d3d7e02b8876dbe23b1da39a3",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "c3200b2f58f42e4a1dea5dfdf9b361608992c011ec7ad2b155981b07f71b5f6b",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:29:44.933965Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:01c5059546762c3da721da5af276fce8cf7d8c5a7378467ccbce1634623ca92d#results[45];abstract[1011:1228]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3191388206",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Video class-incremental learning aims to recognize new actions while restricting the catastrophic forgetting of old ones, whose representative samples can only be saved in limited memory.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:194c580f11340e51b1c37fac4da6cb7a01387fe7c093330337b5d072fa9f55d2",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "823971fc7b6f60c1355fd7fb74eaa970260673cb0317c9b3d5e165a283998af6",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:27:24.878086Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:be120c57ed8816e6b9b691ab1aa00ef2f9cefc715e29c4f1b2f83d1031b5a49a#results[38];abstract[0:187]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4393149366",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Starting from the premise, we envision a neural data structure, which we term the meta-sketch, to go beyond the basic structure of conventional sketches.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:1fa648e821a008447d15fb749cc516e5f4719ade34c9affb17d3d8ecf8c868ac",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "a9129c34608fe5dcea87cff49a5617efacec425c5adfba848adf56de6ac5765f",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:26:49.031638Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:f80c85db055bf4eb624f70994a68fae67b8224e5cc8587cd34d87003c26278eb#results[18];abstract[301:454]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4382239176",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Only self-supervisedly pre-trained on the denoising task, SiamTrans is tested on three different low-level vision tasks (deraining, demoireing, and desnowing).",
      "id": "evidence:topic:1fdda866d6ff68ad625e25a30b462c2fb9079ac3e81ce5bf08f51900921ec232",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "f4df7585a937d665c848c624c29dccc6fb35f48b3153bf241d1e4a16f9dfb354",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:25:34.686352Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:43f70b8a66387275d810917c4cd80bcaa5fbbd3b5f992f4f416c83fce372d698#results[37];abstract[727:886]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4226016551",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "However, the complexity of these approaches is non-trivial with large memory footprint, which limits their capability to jointly perform feature learning and aggregation.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:211d7a27b3ce73248555dc27877329ce9c5105f28077a629653fd06180a3552d",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "e437a65356197b605087e235abf99320a01b7221c6cba689e0e1c9016fb3f237",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:25:41.082498Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:1006cc8a44818b4cefc731788cd38802f557ae377d547125cc57d3af8bb065b9#results[36];abstract[309:479]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4283810715",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Specifically, the MDL block interactively processes the local spatial features and the global frequency information to facilitate complementary learning, leading to fine-grained features generation.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:2172602e41b07bb7aace8c449abd3b22d8f99f47988a5aa3631c4fda55edf699",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "b88552045c5ebab904242bbaff713f051443fb0e73d5de7e334f6e03cfc64566",
