      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409365223",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Concretely, Class Feature Banks (CFB) consist of sub-banks for each class, which are utilized to collect diversity information from a broader view.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:24c10afadbe5025b118c845fe4c77774a1536390b9901d1187bfb1f1e80fc79b",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
