      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4283822559",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "To this end, in this paper, we propose a Preference-Adaptive Meta-Learning approach (PAML) to improve existing meta-learning frameworks with better generalization capacity.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:534dc93c142edfac4046045e0e97bdfecd62922c1feb93117cd0fd1de362d2d9",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "2063dc3530c681a61e9a81a8084746728ba5b7210e1a057029c08530374995b4",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:29:47.122458Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:fe1cf61385e7bc9b640fb1f4448e443f3e863c5f1f01b78687a0c24adbf35ba4#results[13];abstract[601:773]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3190638878",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "In this work, we propose a novel Actionness Inconsistency-guided Contrastive Learning (AICL) method which utilizes the consistent segments to boost the representation learning of the inconsistent segments.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:5395e9fca38796c872bf044e9dd68fbb3040f6c00e1f4103932e9fecde35a8c8",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "51125f07fc8273979ddd6c368a5f08291133302aaeb78fc98ca26670c3ca7076",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:26:29.241817Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:ceadad0546162e57bc5ba179e018916519ac3c625ad2306eac7d29880447ad3a#results[28];abstract[564:769]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4382457788",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "To our knowledge, we are the first to employ the GNN as a fundamental component to transform dense NLOS grid data into sparse structural features for efficient reconstruction.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:5503067aa51fcbe2d68565672f563cb51359a00e374f428b046e0c767adab1ed",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "d1ec7005b2f0021ffcd67a4fc36c807eb53a8f94769ba4119dbfa92392bc231f",
