      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409347210",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Specifically, HOIMamba builds an efficient and effective decoder through cascaded Low-Rank Adaptations (LoRAs), with high efficiency, thorough decoupling of tasks, and good multi-task collaborative learning.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:5ba4e52f6b8d4afbb2c041ec89ba1030c17d32fe262162d8e49ef907cd29619a",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "2e95fd9c9d51f982c394399e68aeb10d87d00ba60b699de04debb9802b28ffb0",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:28:51.090739Z",
