      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409365910",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Specifically, our SDAG employs the subsequent pre-trained recognition model extractor to extract semantic representations, and then learns to self-reconstruct the enhanced low-light image and its augmented degraded images.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:5bf7287fe5c4f97a0bcf6fd204a8ce127cc2f7058b1a87f31c263aeacc4a2f1d",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
