      "source_locator": "openalex-request:9f2d26fdd4af84afd63414673ee294e59ba6d63748e3b1d0bd941f623490a0e0#results[9];abstract[0:92]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3184256368",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Further, we devise an adaptive re-weight relation module that determines how much semantic and geometric attention should be activated to each relation feature.",
