      "source_locator": "openalex-request:a0ffca83d6193c00c1dded26a073da0fa10c777c4afb89663ddd44edd49e12ae#results[19];abstract[1137:1297]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4285606316",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Recent approaches have utilized self-supervised auxiliary tasks as representation learning to improve the performance and sample efficiency of vision-based reinforcement learning algorithms in single-agent settings.",
