      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4385768055",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Current few-shot segmentation (FSS) approaches have made tremendous achievements based on prototypical learning techniques.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:6896dc8ba31ade2392528a42df0f2555170f1b01fd905b09da6687cd4c03a246",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "b88552045c5ebab904242bbaff713f051443fb0e73d5de7e334f6e03cfc64566",
