      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4385767776",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "To this end, we build an attention-free network called sMLPNet based on the existing MLP-based vision models.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:6a600894b7b667c924c2ba97834581a1002d1ec1562c763bd861508e115815aa",
