      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409364536",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Then, by involving a macro-sector context, stock representations are learned in a self-supervised way that can further be used for downstream tasks like stock movement prediction.",
