      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4285600262",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "To tackle this problem, we propose the global convolution-attention block (GCA) to rescale the channels of the feature maps.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:978fae0ca0472c163448897470dae75b71ec2fe7f51cb614d4524680222029cf",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "2d2c6b71538f18e75313851a34329c6e39ae5b5e8b3a1a57103c13ce52a01c4f",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:26:23.818140Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:469dd1e2039930611e16ccacc246271e88c139c992cb8286450781bb05f25a6c#results[2];abstract[723:847]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4382240798",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Subsequently, through local manifold learning, the reconstructed pseudo-labels are leveraged to propagate the consistency relationship between labels and instances, thereby improving the accuracy of pseudo-labels.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:985d93b37498f5388b00b6c54f80fff34603945b1a75fa61fae93717c1499970",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "51c77a0768c3fc601b05d9a9e8c915a6824a2c126ea0a552c356ddb91fbf6d9e",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:31:10.707599Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:d7284ba2e501e4b4fa68b884ec9169996a770a9e372aa7b8d9c6b8de03d3fdbb#results[31];abstract[896:1109]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4414359574",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Our results show the effectiveness of both the proposed model and the transfer learning strategy.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:98e87227feb2da704951a7f3b6370201455bfcca61dc90c9f5ae5e0a77b0e92a",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "17399b07c67aa600e818296b06161126b33017304f507754302d527f9f409b82",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:25:26.132467Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:7f21a584aba3767f0ff04c17a4eaf19b723daf495acde5ae5053263fb13cf358#results[29];abstract[906:1003]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3174954176",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "After pre-training, we fine-tune the pre-trained encoder on the downstream SLR task, jointly with the newly added task-specific layer.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:9a5d6697aaf90c7d3d14bae2d74f5b98d56d50769b669096582f57856e23f85c",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "6909c7889866945433f83df6872cf745c975d068309e4e526d6b6b3395670705",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:26:38.516028Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:e10fbbceba1b077a14fb4bd78ac6fe8e9fa5466450f893e2884c7e0cd3c7163f#results[6];abstract[986:1120]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4382240029",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "In the global optimization module, optimal transport is only utilized to generate pseudo-labels during the training phase, facilitating the efficient global planning of the correspondence results.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:9ab0ce98c2fd7922dfad02ad665a37eed9bdd3dd88030175fa5c86311dfe7c38",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "a8fb6e831fda313182556268d11bb88aeba6a3fc89cb6b50e5ab3c58fe1ca7c4",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:28:30.868278Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:13742f76db6d03bca18c9d216e890290d2592e2c2bef669ec1ecd076b665584a#results[42];abstract[928:1124]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409369478",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Among them is predicting transformations as a pretext task to self-train representations, which has shown great potentials for unsupervised learning.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:aa0fd9e7e3c38d1b9e0f91810eb3783c0b4ecd03eeb9544f26388bba8a5e265a",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "2f467711eedb4b4d0c9c7a16e78495298c2f79fa01da9effb5563f91c974d508",
