      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3174950435",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "To this end, we propose LeRet, a Language-empowered Retentive network for TSF.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:acc7710bc8d43c79403ac20ffb9c984f8b4bb7da29528907fb41b1993e4849c2",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "0f718ca53da773a631bad66680b71db8f781e97412d5532ec4892b11e32e6456",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:30:47.815879Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:57bacf954260670141d732a834e802db5a65132207ef5a42d7a259db5fab1b3c#results[8];abstract[637:715]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4401024286",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "We aim to address these challenges by leveraging the powerful latent space representation and reconstruction capabilities of Variational Autoencoders (VAE).",
      "id": "evidence:topic:b2e489b73f65438ba6c38b7fd97d1b46c1a79907053965da2efc89e4d42c06f8",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
