      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409366980",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Then, a novel Temporal Graph Contrastive Learning (TGCL) mechanism is designed to enhance the uniformity of representations between augmented graphs from identical sequences.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:b2f831bb5a4708db2404512c72800fbf4be117c36374ecdc095e537b6b26abe6",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
