      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "By extracting semantic information from unlabeled data, self-supervised methods can improve the performance of downstream tasks, among which the mask image model (MIM) has been widely used due to its simplicity and effectiveness in recovering original information from masked images.",
