      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409362890",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Addressing this, recent studies leverage transfer learning to migrate knowledge from data-rich (source) to data-poor (target) cities.",
