      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4382465803",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Unsupervised domain adaptation (UDA) methods have been proposed to address this issue, but they often overlook the reliability of pseudo-labels and the effectiveness of supervision signals.",
