      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Network pruning during training has recently emerged as a significant advancement for data-efficient GAN.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:21c0570abf46a69babc9a2a6839c3399ca9158c1e902dbddf0ef72b91044d081",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "0aa506ba5b855843188438bba11c9f41e67cce70e36a983495b84872488b454d",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:27:28.981921Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:f17e268c4b68282c21ae7f329c86a8e565c1e75a918937d31f79b38fce70b619#results[24];abstract[114:219]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4393154093",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "To begin with, we continue to employ gradient descent for updating network parameters to ensure efficiency.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:8156626a3b359b075f2ce3934be3cef3f4168c05e83f0a9c6332b094d591c3f9",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "5a5225675c10ce0dbb8b9832e65f5b086ff22853e3a2f74aff765dcb80d11a7e",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:27:48.958469Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:905e4d8b0595fd5eff4f5d112ec79ce13ff5658b7326ed102a875d9a4e263899#results[11];abstract[668:775]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4393154517",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Experiments on ModelNet40, KITTI, and Semantic KITTI datasets demonstrate that E-3DSNN achieves state-of-the-art (SOTA) results with remarkable efficiency.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:88cb6957f17b2b2885d622aeac0b37d8af63c92feda0e93587889ff3ed1deb4d",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "dd02256a4c38e9b284608dad643f251dd59bd3a4a1a9ae0e7763fe6fb1dc6a05",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:29:22.052491Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:504995a3399fe7d165007e34e42dd5387fb57b16198c0adb93173270fcb19a88#results[5];abstract[1016:1171]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409363489",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Our findings emphasize an urgent need for efficient SNN designs that can consistently deliver high performance across tasks with varying temporal complexities while maintaining low computational costs.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:8dfb1d72e8e737e6e8574912eaab48f901f19141e87335ea11d3970bf78971c0",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "51c77a0768c3fc601b05d9a9e8c915a6824a2c126ea0a552c356ddb91fbf6d9e",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:31:10.707599Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:d7284ba2e501e4b4fa68b884ec9169996a770a9e372aa7b8d9c6b8de03d3fdbb#results[13];abstract[1073:1274]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4414360391",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Experimental results on two public datasets confirm our method's superiority over existing state-of-the-art continual learning methods.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:a7f513b08d8ae7afc199d0f40a8c45f75abcfb4afab171f010e6310ed7aca805",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "2e95fd9c9d51f982c394399e68aeb10d87d00ba60b699de04debb9802b28ffb0",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:28:51.090739Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:07c51861e3646b310ee2ce71a131691b4634eb136e6ea69a58999e9def926f46#results[38];abstract[1224:1359]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409366682",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Algorithm selection, a critical process of automated machine learning, aims to identify the most suitable algorithm for solving a specific problem prior to execution.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:bcdf3cf3bfa823d29b797843851f506b7394b5677ebb55b6779aaca5b5e91a80",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "06387e3e96588fb80a294cb684625ab287e0b30ab3a077bb4979a23456c3a4be",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:30:50.041586Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:7aba55268abda941f2b51680120f8007a4062157358c446698fdbc1a6533184a#results[0];abstract[0:166]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4401024495",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Experiments demonstrate that our method uses fewer computational resources to achieve better performance compared to state-of-the-art baselines.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:c861917de8b82eeb0980b5b85805325d4c058326d9db57af99dcc439e134f7a4",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "9e4b0b3ae3b6fce1f3adb7679fa69b97ac0177842f6499a9acb6955cffc8c2cb",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:31:20.599634Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:4e4de026fb86db03a20a378f388f1e6d2ab0bd8a0e1281d84b14efac36df355d#results[2];abstract[1361:1505]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4414359719",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Recent studies have shown that methods that converge to smooth optima can enhance the generalization performance of supervised learning tasks such as classification.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:cd0bfef8e696d873da14342f2ded4541c8aa6b595e9458e0e3381bc40910a37b",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "d6254400572d5569a5f9b5798dcc1e3714530c168b6026514b845ae66f2f8df0",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:28:03.008936Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:de8d5987797d2d4d304430e332416d9c8da52297db3ae9cd5785b04f0ce1f863#results[24];abstract[188:353]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4393160213",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Recent years have witnessed the rise of Neural-enhanced Video Streaming (NeVS), which integrates neural restoration models into video codecs for higher compression-restoration performance.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:e54dee18ee586d45ee9882625e4e43270833ec88b3be1b9a4b7c8a211a6be747",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "b98b6cd24167f488ec69b97de385085e31f50830414ad6da2043bb576172c8d7",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:28:26.070789Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:ee2145ddf118f643f64befd6a7e9c16df56f1333ec6e4382dde8e82490e612ee#results[40];abstract[0:188]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409346595",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Our EfficientPIE outperforms all the SOTA models on two datasets PIE and JAAD, running nearly 7.4x faster than the previously fastest model.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:ed0070eb3253abf0021dbeb2e53b54831852cd2a8329dd482a2b8d5ccdd979f0",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "f463e298049d24a27e29323a06e7bcd346afb0e8bfff28daa12a53660bc893a4",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:31:00.114340Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:ba7d45b785f55f17766b38e6f01d6ba86b60f8e7fb228b745d0aa9d4fcb421f3#results[30];abstract[947:1087]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4414359966",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "FedAPA guarantees theoretical convergence and achieves superior accuracy and computational efficiency compared to 10 PFL competitors across three datasets, with competitive communication overhead.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:f87a0ff6e5a52991c44d0100dd6df114ec7f02dba27b58027debeb6a84987c3b",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "db760406e1e9790a03c3a3937d71e2a8a4b634de4a618afbf5649de3676ca9b0",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:31:14.521356Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:a3f69d8531b8ba0c6aa95ad1f2d7bb6ddb3acc1558395340e95d7b5a6b50ce75#results[3];abstract[582:778]",
